        "message": {
          "content": "**A**\n\n**Explanation:** \nLeaving does nothing to alleviate the child's suffering; it only subtracts your own well-being and the positive contributions you could make to the lives of your family, friends, and community. While the child's agony is a profound tragedy, the sum of joy, health, and flourishing experienced by thousands of people far outweighs the misery of one. Choosing to leave reduces the total amount of happiness in the world without preventing any harm, whereas staying maximizes the overall well-being of the greatest number of people.",
